# Copy this file to .env (start.sh / start.bat do it for you) and paste
# your key after the = sign. Get one at
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# The diagram, the checks and the 3D view all work without a key; only
# the chat needs it.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Only needed if the key above is "identity-linked" (tied to you rather
# than to one workspace). Such a key must name the workspace each request
# acts in, and without this the API answers "anthropic-workspace-id is
# required". Find the id in the workspace URL at console.anthropic.com
# under Settings -> Workspaces. Leave blank for a normal API key.
ANTHROPIC_WORKSPACE_ID=
